DEPLOYMENT RUNBOOK OWNERSHIP

The Markdown files in this directory are source-build defaults for local
development and tests. They are not the source of truth for a deployed
multiagent service.

Production runbooks are versioned under
InternalServices/artifacts/multiagent/runbooks, selected by that repository's
service catalog, digest-bound to prod-mcp policy, and mounted over these default
paths at deployment time.

Do not make a production procedure change only in this directory. Change the
authoritative InternalServices artifact, update its semantic version and
prod-mcp digest when required, and then mirror the resulting content here when
source builds should carry the same default.
